1 CONC ccupations, and whether single, widowed, or divorced at the time of the marriage. Often a marriage license will also contain information about the parentsof the bride and groom including the parents’ names and birthplaces. Copies of the origina
1 CONC l marriage records in New York City are available for order for a fee from www.nyc.gov/records. Marriages 50 or more years old are classified as public documents and are available to all researchers.
